    "name": "Social Platform API — Full Collection (Fixed)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Consolidated, corrected collection built directly against the provided NestJS controllers (auth, post, comment, friendship, block, group, hashtag, message). Auth is inherited at the collection level as Bearer {{accessToken}}, auto-populated by the Sign In / Refresh requests' test scripts. Public routes override auth to 'No Auth'.\n\nEndpoints for 'reaction' were kept from the original file but flagged ⚠️ because no reaction controller source was supplied to verify them. Endpoints for /media/*, /search/*, /search-history/*, and /conversation/* (as opposed to /message/conversation/:id) that appeared in the old files were NOT included here because no matching controller source was provided — ask if you want them added once you share those controllers."
  },
